Bind Npc 24426 Zone 71 for karus
Bind Npc 14426 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 282 "Secure a Strategic Point!"
    Journal for karus "You will receive 2,500,000 EXP for hunting 20 Falcons and 250 Crimson Wings, and 5,000,000 EXP if you have Premium (But, the reward will not be given if you are 75Lv or higher)."
    Journal for elmorad "You will receive 2,500,000 EXP for hunting 20 Falcons and 250 Crimson Wings, and 5,000,000 EXP if you have Premium (But, the reward will not be given if you are 75Lv or higher)."
    Kill 20 of 2256
    Kill 20 of 2223

Requires player level >= 60 and player level <= 73

Rewards
    Give 2500000 experience or 5000000 with premium

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Hey, <selfname>!! We're going against El Morad again shortly. But there's something I want you to take care of first. (Indicating the map) Here, and here... These are important strategic sites, and we need to take and hold them. One is a supply route; the other can be used to hit the enemy from the rear and cut-off their frontal assault."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "No doubt El Morad has the same idea, so it's vital that you get on this immediately.  Before you can secure these points fully, you'll first have to eliminate  Falcon and the  Crimson Wing"
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Hey, <selfname>!! We're going against Karus again shortly. But there's something I want you to take care of first. (Indicating the map) Here, and here... These are important strategic sites, and we need to take and hold them. One is a supply route; the other can be used to hit the enemy from the rear and cut-off their frontal assault."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "No doubt Karus has the same idea, so it's vital that you get on this immediately.  Before you can secure these points fully, you'll first have to eliminate  Falcon and the  Crimson Wing"

On in_progress
    Say "Falcon and Crimson Wing are Harpys. Take 'em out by using their low intelligence against them."

On ready
    Say "Brilliant work Master, you've secured both areas. Time to report back to base I think."
    Topic "Confirm" goto close

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "Nicely done! Great! We claim these strategic points in the name of Karus!"
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "Nicely done! Great! We claim these strategic points in the name of El Morad!"
